# The Chain Veil: "At the beginning of your end step, if you didn't activate a
# loyalty ability of a planeswalker this turn, you lose 2 life" -- CheckSVar$ X
# EQ0 over Count$ThisTurnActivated_Activated.Loyalty+Planeswalker+YouCtrl
# (AbilityUtils.java:2805-2816), the activations MagicStack.java:310 records
# with their host (:983-987) and clears as the next turn begins (:968).
startturn human
advance 3
# Turn 1: Ajani's +1 (ability 0) gains 2 life, so the end step trigger does not fire.
queue action human activate 2 0
passpriority
advance 8
resolvestack
# Turn 3: no activation, so at the end step human loses 2.
advance 2
advance 13
advance 11
resolvestack
